@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam stateBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam stateStartColor #60C7E5
skinparam stateEndColor #60C7E5
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 48
hide empty description
top to bottom direction

title SM-M05 — Candidate admission and confirmed usable artifact
state "Candidate content\nidentified" as Candidate
state "Awaiting usable completion" as Pending
state "Confirmed usable artifact" as Available
state "Admission rejected" as Rejected
state "Definite processing failure" as Failed
[*] --> Candidate : scoped initial context
Candidate --> Pending : SM-T022 candidate admitted\n[admission permitted]
Candidate --> Rejected : SM-T023 admission rejected\n[applicable rule denies]
Pending --> Available : SM-T024 usable result confirmed\n[actual usable result]
Pending --> Failed : SM-T025 definite failure observed\n[definite evidence]
Available --> Available : SM-T026 live source changes\n[different content context]
legend bottom
A: accepted core behavior; P: existing proposal; R: proposed refinement.
State labels are analysis abstractions, not implemented enums.
Transition tables define full actor, guard, effect and status.
Unconfirmed operation effects require SM-M18 reconciliation.
endlegend
@enduml
